Association StudentIEPResponsibleContactAssociation
    documentation "EARLY ACCESS: This association relates a contact to a student's Individualized Education Program (IEP) and identifies the responsibility the contact has for the student, effective beginning on a specific date."
    domain entity StudentIEP
        documentation "A reference to the student's IEP for which the contact has the specified responsibility."
    domain entity Contact
        documentation "A reference to the contact who has the specified responsibility for the student."
    descriptor ContactResponsibility
        documentation "Defines the type of responsibility a contact has for a specific student IEP. Examples include: IDEA Parent"
        is part of identity
    date ContactResponsibilityBeginDate
        documentation "The date on which the specific contact responsibility for the student IEP becomes effective. Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is part of identity
    date ContactResponsibilityEndDate
        documentation "The date on which the specific contact responsibility for the student IEP ends. Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is optional